OL,3,CTens of thousands celebrate Brighton
OL,4,CPride as police step up security
OL,6,FThousands of people have taken to the
OL,7,Fstreets of Brighton and Hove for this
OL,8,Fyear's Pride.
OL,10,FA huge parade weaved its way through
OL,11,Fthe city after setting off from Hove
OL,12,FLawns.
OL,14,FThe parade has become a symbol of
OL,15,Ftolerance and a celebration of
OL,16,Fdiversity.
OL,18,FThe event is now in its 35th year.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/2
