OL,3,CTens of thousands celebrate Brighton
OL,4,CPride as police step up security
OL,6,FSussex Police say security is a
OL,7,Fpriority this weekend, following the
OL,8,Fattack on a Pride event in Berlin that
OL,9,Fleft one woman dead and twenty-nine
OL,10,Fpeople injured.
OL,12,FBrighton Pride generates thirty
OL,13,Fmillion pounds for the local economy
OL,14,Fwith around three hundred thousand
OL,15,Fpeople taking part over the weekend.
OL,17,FSingers, Nick Cave, Raye and Diana
OL,18,FRoss are among some of the major acts
OL,19,Fappearing on stage at Preston Park.
